    {
      "id": 6314,
      "nameEs": "TNN Outdoors Fishing Champ",
      "originalName": "TNN Outdoors Fishing Champ",
      "year": 2000,
      "igdbId": 49994,
      "popularity": 0,
      "iconic": false,
      "fields": [
        {
          "field": "name_es",
          "value": "TNN Outdoors Fishing Champ",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "TNN Outdoors Fishing Champ",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Get out the rod and reel, because the challenge of fishing can now be put into the palm of your hand thanks to TNN OUTDOORS FISHING CHAMP. Play in the Free Fishing mode to get a feel for the game controls and learn how to reel-in the big one. When you want to test your mettle, try to become the undisputed fishing champion in the Tournament mode. You will have to travel to six different tournaments and catch a predetermined number of a specific kind of fish to stay alive in each. If your friends are fishing fanatics, you can challenge them and see who can catch the most fish in an hour. In all of the modes, there are over 30 different varieties of fish to catch including bluegill, catfish, walleye, rainbow trout, lake trout, and largemouth bass. Play TNN OUTDOORS FISHING CHAMP and have a fish tale to tell your friends.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "¡Saca la caña y el carrete, porque el reto de la pesca ya puede tenerse en la palma de tu mano gracias a TNN OUTDOORS FISHING CHAMP! Juega en el modo Free Fishing para familiarizarte con los controles y aprender a recoger el pez grande. Cuando quieras poner a prueba tu temple, intenta convertirte en el indiscutido campeón de pesca en el modo Tournament. Deberás viajar a seis torneos diferentes y atrapar una cantidad predeterminada de un tipo específico de pez para seguir en competencia en cada uno. Si tus amigos son fanáticos de la pesca, puedes desafiarlos y ver quién atrapa más peces en una hora. En todos los modos hay más de 30 variedades de peces para atrapar, como pez sol, bagre, lucioperca, trucha arcoíris, trucha de lago y black bass de boca grande. ¡Juega TNN OUTDOORS FISHING CHAMP y ten una buena historia de pesca que contarles a tus amigos!",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2000",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
